---
title: "cancel (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller != projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_published --> q_revert_state: results already published
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert CannotCancelAfterResults
    q_check_published --> q_set_canceled: results not published
    q_set_canceled --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled

    note right of q_check_published
        INV-001: cancellation only allowed before results publication
        INV-002: only projectAdmin can cancel
    end note
